  moveName: Earthquake
  description: 'Leaps toward the designated location, creating a 2.5m earthquake
    on landing. Three increasingly powerful waves occur 0.6s apart. Each damages
    and slows opponents by 20%. Opponents hit by all three waves are incapacitated
    for 1.2s and slowed by 25% for 3.2s (2s remaining after incapacitation).
    Flygon can move and attack while the later waves continue.

    Upgrade: hitting an opposing player with the final wave grants a shield equal
    to 8% of maximum HP for 3s. Only one shield is granted per cast.'
